            "detailed_description": "Join Sylvester &quot;Sly&quot; Boots and Stiletto Anyway as they trek across six bizarre planets investigating a galaxy-crushing mystery, searching for artefacts from an extinct alien race and unlocking the secrets of a powerful, advanced technology. It's your turn. PICK YOUR POISON.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Craft your team from a cast of seven characters. Unravel evil galactic schemes, solve devious puzzles and fight wicked monsters.<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in amazing turn-based real-time battles. Assemble alien weapons and master challenging mini-games.<br></li><li>All this, plus mind-blowing cinematics and a heavy dose of gut-busting humour.</li></ul>",
